{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 MaxPane - Nested Docker Layouts for REAPER\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 A native C++ extension that turns any REAPER window into a tile inside a multi-pane workspace. Up to 8 independent containers, drag-to-dock from outside, 32 saved workspaces, hotkeys for everything, Quick Switcher, floating mode, and a launcher that remembers your layouts.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 What's new in 2.0\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Drag-to-dock - grab any REAPER window and drop it on a pane with live preview\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Up to 8 independent MaxPane containers per session (multi-instance)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Floating mode - detach a container into its own OS window, multi-monitor aware, always-on-top toggle\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Quick Switcher - fuzzy-match across open tabs, workspaces, and favorites\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab 32 workspace slots + 32 favorite slots with bindable hotkeys\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Persistent navigation toolbar (Home, Drag, Switch, Save, Load, Settings, Support)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Workspace launcher - card grid with mini layout previews on empty containers\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Reopen last closed tab, pinned tabs, Close Others / to Right / All\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Settings dialog with dark-mode override and live preference editing\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Reliability: close-leak bugs eliminated; WM_CLOSE primary, action toggle fallback, startup ghost cleanup\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Core features\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Flexible split layouts (up to 16 panes), tabbed panes, drag-and-drop\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Solo/maximize pane, 5 layout presets, tab colors\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab 15 known REAPER windows with one-click capture, plus arbitrary capture (toolbars, ReaImGui scripts)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Per-project state saved inside .RPP files via project_config_extension\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Dockable into REAPER's native docker system\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab macOS dark/light mode auto + manual override\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Zero scripting dependencies - pure C++ extension\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Requirements\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab REAPER 7.0+\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab macOS arm64 + x86_64\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Windows x64 (v2.0.1+)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Linux x86_64 + aarch64 (v2.0.2+)\sa180\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
